                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Olaf had been with the company since the ’00s. His desk overflowed with heaps of paper, apple cores and squeaky toys. We couldn’t find Olaf’s keyboard. The state of his desk was replicated, in triplicate, across all of the werewolves’ desks."
