                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "You can get the same result by inserting a typographic apostrophe immediately following a constrained formatting pair. In this case, you’re able to leverage the fact that a typographic apostrophe is a punctuation character to avoid the need to resort to unconstrained formatting."
